    "Defense Attributes": "Fire 20, Water 20, Wind 53, Earth 20, Holy 20, Unholy 20",
    "Skills": "Raid Boss Lv. 1 Raid Boss reward chance is reduced based on the level difference. Boss is higher: +5 - 85%, +6 - 70%, +7 - 50%, +8 - 35%. Player is higher: +6 - 85%, +7 - 70%, +8 - 50%. If player is 9 or more levels higher, Raid Curse is applied. Raid Boss Lv. 1 A Pan who was once a long-time friend of the Elves, and guarded the ancient Elven Forest. The Pans stayed neutral during the tragic war between the Elves and the Dark Elves, and both sides turned against them. The other Pans retreated into hiding after suffering cruel attacks from both sides, but Pay Dryad still remains here waiting for the golden age of peace to return. Fairies Lv. 13 Takes 15% increased damage from attacks that are effective against Fairies. M. Def. +5% Atk. Spd. +5% Resistance to Wind +10% Resistance to Speed Down -20% Max HP -5% Resistance to Earth -10% Resist Full Magic Attack Lv. 1",
